# rustup's installer, rustup-init, pinned by version and SHA-256 for each Mac
# it runs on (desktop/scripts/switch-from-swift.sh installs Rust with it on a
# Mac that has no rustup). Never sh.rustup.rs: that's whatever the server
# hands out today, run unchecked (Daybreak 173, 23 Nov 2026).
#
# Moving it on: take the version from
# https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/release-stable.toml, then for each
# target download
# https://static.rust-lang.org/rustup/archive/<version>/<target>/rustup-init
# and check `shasum -a 256` of it matches the .sha256 file beside it before
# changing both lines here in one commit.
#
# version target sha256
1.29.3 aarch64-apple-darwin 63752a1919a3a4793173ec70f8f212621a7ce38ba6a246095984482f4de20f9f
1.29.3 x86_64-apple-darwin bc107f1fb0228de7fa32413c89c1b305cea9cd256e94b01150cd054128145429
